1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,755
This is Bullpen.

2
00:00:00,755 --> 00:00:02,123
Source control for AI agents.

3
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:05,720
Two AI agents, two branches.

4
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:07,106
Both are green against main.

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,955
But both rewrite the same lines of auth.ts.

6
00:00:12,267 --> 00:00:13,512
Git only finds out at merge.

7
00:00:13,512 --> 00:00:14,935
One lands, and the other breaks.

8
00:00:16,233 --> 00:00:17,660
Bullpen stops it before it happens.

9
00:00:18,867 --> 00:00:19,694
You type one ask.

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,966
Three Claude Code agents start work,

11
00:00:22,966 --> 00:00:23,903
each on its own branch.

12
00:00:25,200 --> 00:00:26,582
Two of them want the same file.

13
00:00:26,582 --> 00:00:27,385
One gets the lock.

14
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:29,539
The other waits in line,

15
00:00:29,539 --> 00:00:30,447
so nothing is overwritten.

16
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:33,108
A guarded folder needs a human.

17
00:00:33,108 --> 00:00:34,482
Bullpen shows an approval card.

18
00:00:35,767 --> 00:00:36,754
Deny it, and the agent

19
00:00:36,754 --> 00:00:37,741
writes a plan instead.

20
00:00:39,033 --> 00:00:40,489
Don't like one agent's work?

21
00:00:40,489 --> 00:00:41,320
Undo that agent.

22
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,724
Only its branch rolls back.

23
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:44,713
Happy with another?

24
00:00:44,713 --> 00:00:45,499
Merge it to main.

25
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:48,731
The other branches sync with it at once.

26
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:51,826
Every edit is checked by a referee,

27
00:00:51,826 --> 00:00:53,576
on separate hardware the agents can't touch.

28
00:00:54,867 --> 00:00:56,968
Pause the referee, and every edit is denied.

29
00:00:56,968 --> 00:00:57,732
It fails closed.

30
00:00:59,033 --> 00:01:00,556
And every edit is a commit, tagged

31
00:01:00,556 --> 00:01:01,810
with the agent that made it.

32
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:04,154
Git tracks what changed.

33
00:01:04,154 --> 00:01:06,085
Bullpen controls who's allowed to change it.
